---
---

<section id="metode" class="w-full bg-near-black text-[#f5f4ed] py-24 sm:py-32 rounded-soft relative z-20 my-12 shadow-2xl scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 md:px-12">
    
    <!-- Title Header Saku 'The Architects' Style -->
    <div class="flex flex-col mb-16 md:mb-20">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#fbdcd1] font-mono tracking-widest uppercase">
          System Pipeline &bull; Computer Vision Project
        </span>
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
        <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-surface-variant font-body">Python &bull; Golang &bull; Astro JS</span>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-headline font-medium mb-4 tracking-tight text-[#f5f4ed]">
        Data Flow Architecture
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl text-surface-variant font-headline italic font-light leading-relaxed max-w-4xl border-l-4 border-primary pl-6 sm:pl-8">
        How visual information flows sequentially from camera lenses to the driver screen.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Horizontal Pipeline Stages -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-12">
      
      <!-- STAGE 1: CCTV -->
      <div class="bg-surface-container-highest/5 rounded-2xl p-7 border border-surface-variant/10 flex flex-col justify-between h-full">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
            <span class="text-4xl font-headline font-light text-surface-variant/30 italic">01</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono tracking-wider uppercase bg-surface-container-highest/15 text-surface-variant px-2.5 py-1 rounded">
              Camera Feed
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-headline font-medium text-[#f5f4ed] mb-2">
            Surveillance CCTV
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-surface-variant leading-relaxed font-body">
            High-mounted cameras monitor asphalt parking bays continuously. Every frame captures vehicle arrivals, departures, or temporary event booth installations.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-surface-variant/10 text-xs font-mono text-surface-variant">
          RTSP Stream &bull; 30 FPS
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- STAGE 2: PYTHON CV -->
      <div class="bg-surface-container-highest/5 rounded-2xl p-7 border border-surface-variant/10 flex flex-col justify-between h-full">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
            <span class="text-4xl font-headline font-light text-primary/40 italic">02</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono tracking-wider uppercase bg-primary/10 text-[#fbdcd1] px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-bold">
              Python YOLOv8
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-headline font-medium text-[#f5f4ed] mb-2">
            Object Detection
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-surface-variant leading-relaxed font-body">
            The Computer Vision model projects detected vehicle bounding boxes onto 4 calibrated ROI coordinates, computing overlap ratios with low latency (&lt;40ms).
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-surface-variant/10 text-xs font-mono text-primary">
          Inference &bull; OpenCV + YOLO
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- STAGE 3: GOLANG BACKEND -->
      <div class="bg-surface-container-highest/5 rounded-2xl p-7 border border-surface-variant/10 flex flex-col justify-between h-full">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
            <span class="text-4xl font-headline font-light text-surface-variant/30 italic">03</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono tracking-wider uppercase bg-surface-container-highest/15 text-surface-variant px-2.5 py-1 rounded">
              Golang Backend
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-headline font-medium text-[#f5f4ed] mb-2">
            Validation &amp; Rules
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-surface-variant leading-relaxed font-body">
            The Golang service validates vision states against database schedules: checking if a bay is genuinely free or reserved for campus expo events and sponsors.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-surface-variant/10 text-xs font-mono text-surface-variant">
          REST API &bull; WebSocket Hub
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- STAGE 4: ASTRO JS -->
      <div class="bg-surface-container-highest/5 rounded-2xl p-7 border border-surface-variant/10 flex flex-col justify-between h-full">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
            <span class="text-4xl font-headline font-light text-[#fbdcd1]/40 italic">04</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono tracking-wider uppercase bg-surface-container-highest/15 text-[#fbdcd1] px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-bold">
              Astro JS UI
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-headline font-medium text-[#f5f4ed] mb-2">
            Driver Interface
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-surface-variant leading-relaxed font-body">
            Frontend clients update bay statuses instantly, highlighting the optimal vacant parking slot and marking bays temporarily closed for campus activities.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-surface-variant/10 text-xs font-mono text-[#fbdcd1]">
          Live View &bull; Guidance
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- SPECIAL LOGIC: CAMPUS EVENT & SPONSOR HANDLING -->
    <div class="bg-surface-container-highest/5 rounded-2xl p-8 sm:p-10 border border-surface-variant/10 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-8">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary"></span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase text-[#fbdcd1] tracking-wider font-bold">Field Scenario: Bay Reserved for Campus Events / Sponsor Booths</span>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-2xl font-headline font-medium text-[#f5f4ed] mb-2">
          Operational Flexibility Without False Positives
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-surface-variant font-body leading-relaxed">
          When a parking slot is occupied by student organization tents or sponsor exhibition booths, administrators flag the bay in the Golang backend. The system prevents false-positive car detections, displaying <em>"Closed: Campus Sponsor Expo"</em> on the driver dashboard.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="shrink-0 bg-near-black p-5 rounded-xl border border-surface-variant/10 text-xs font-mono text-surface-variant flex flex-col gap-1.5 w-full md:w-auto">
        <span class="text-[#f5f4ed] font-bold">Payload Handling:</span>
        <span class="text-primary">{`"status": "INACTIVE"`}</span>
        <span>{`"reason": "Campus Sponsor Booth"`}</span>
        <span>{`"auto_reroute": true`}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer Stack -->
    <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-surface-variant/10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-surface-variant font-mono">
      <span>Pipeline Stack: <strong class="text-[#f5f4ed]">CCTV Camera &rarr; Python (YOLOv8) &rarr; Golang Service &rarr; Astro JS UI</strong></span>
      <span>Informatics Engineering &bull; Computer Vision UAS Project</span>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
